WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.745
Your own sky, tonight.

00:02.445 --> 00:05.894
Here is your part of the world as tonight's dark arrives.

00:06.344 --> 00:11.273
We are going down to the ground to look up at one patch of sky, three times.

00:11.723 --> 00:17.470
First as a city shows it, then from a town's edge, then from somewhere properly dark.
